# Stacks tags of Chapter 17 (Sheaves of Modules) covered by Mathlib

This file registers Mathlib declarations that state definitions and results of the Sheaves of
Modules chapter. Mathlib states them for sheaves of modules over a sheaf of rings `R` on any
site; the ringed-space case is the site `Opens X` with `R = O_X`.

* Tag 01AM: sections generating `F`, and `F` generated by global sections
  (`SheafOfModules.GeneratingSections`, with `SheafOfModules.free` and
  `SheafOfModules.freeHomEquiv` giving the map `⊕_{i ∈ I} O_X → F`).
* Tag 01B2: `F` locally generated by sections (`SheafOfModules.LocalGeneratorsData`; on
  `Opens X`, `Opens.coversTop_iff` turns the covering condition into an open cover).
* Tag 01B5: `F` of finite type (`SheafOfModules.IsFiniteType`).
* Tag 01BE: quasi-coherent sheaves of modules and the category `QCoh(O_X)`
  (`SheafOfModules.IsQuasicoherent`, `SheafOfModules.isQuasicoherent`).
* Tag 01BN: `F` of finite presentation (`SheafOfModules.IsFinitePresentation`).
* Tag 01BO: a module of finite presentation is quasi-coherent
  (`SheafOfModules.instIsQuasicoherentOfIsFinitePresentation`).

